WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.502
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers,
this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.870
We hope you're all doing well.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.671
Now if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:09.041
While in Puerto Rico yesterday
touring Hurricane damage,

00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:11.677
President Biden said
that his home state of Delaware

00:00:11.677 --> 00:00:13.980
has a large Puerto Rican
population

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.448
and added that he was
"sort of raised

00:00:16.448 --> 00:00:19.152
in the Puerto Rican community
at home politically."

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:21.488
Whoa, just take it easy, dude.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:24.323
You sound like someone's grandpa

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:25.958
the first time
they meet a gay person.

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:27.727
"Hey, nice to meet ya.

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:30.230
You know, we had a gay fellow
in Vietnam with us.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.265
At least, you know,
we all thought he was gay

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:34.700
on account of -- yeah,
doesn't matter, you know.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.069
Nice to meet ya.
Do you fella shake hands or...?"

00:00:37.069 --> 00:00:38.738
"Grandpa, stop talking!"

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:40.439
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:42.808
It was reported that
Pennsylvania Senate candidate

00:00:42.808 --> 00:00:45.878
Dr. Mehmet Oz's research team
at Columbia University

00:00:45.878 --> 00:00:48.114
killed hundreds of animals
over several decades,

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.483
including 329 dogs.

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:54.087
Even crazier, it was reported
in his campaign ad.

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:58.892
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:01.127
Producers of
the Netflix series "The Crown"

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:02.428
have announced a casting call

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:04.564
for an actor between
the ages of 16 and 20

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:05.965
to play young Prince Harry,

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:09.736
and an actor between the ages of
55 and 60 to play young William.

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:14.741
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:16.910
A former girlfriend of
Republican Senate --

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.677
Georgia Senate candidate
Herschel Walker

00:01:18.677 --> 00:01:19.712
claimed in a new interview

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:21.014
that Walker paid for her

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:22.915
to get an abortion in 2009.

00:01:22.915 --> 00:01:25.551
And the only way that will
hurt him with Republicans

00:01:25.551 --> 00:01:28.721
is if some of that money went
to pay down her student loans.

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:31.958
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:34.493
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.493 --> 00:01:36.896
I don't know. I'm going to stand
by that one.

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:38.231
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:39.765
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis

00:01:39.765 --> 00:01:42.134
visited a Waffle House
restaurant over the weekend

00:01:42.134 --> 00:01:45.004
and served food to linemen
working to restore power

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.772
in the aftermath
of Hurricane Ian.

00:01:46.772 --> 00:01:48.074
"Thanks for everything you do,"

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:49.943
said DeSantis
to his photographer.

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:52.645
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:55.648
Former President Trump filed a
defamation lawsuit yesterday

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:57.583
against CNN and claimed
that the network has made

00:01:57.583 --> 00:02:00.720
a "persistent association
between Trump and Adolf Hitler."

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:01.921
Yeah. Come on, CNN.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:04.590
Can't a guy
hold a series of racist rallies

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:06.892
in a country
suffering skyrocketing inflation

00:02:06.892 --> 00:02:08.660
without being
compared to Hitler?

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:10.796
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:10.796 --> 00:02:13.566
Peloton. Peloton news.

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:16.202
Peloton announced
a new partnership with Hilton

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:18.104
yesterday
to put exercise bikes

00:02:18.104 --> 00:02:21.540
in more than 5,400 hotels
across the country.

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:24.611
Not to be outdone,
Days Inn announced towels.

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:29.348
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.348 --> 00:02:30.749
In a recent interview,

00:02:30.749 --> 00:02:32.585
country singer Shania Twain
said that

00:02:32.585 --> 00:02:35.021
she wants to collaborate with
Harry Styles in the future.

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:37.790
"Hey, so do we,"
said the rest of One Direction.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:40.092
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.092 --> 00:02:41.293
It was announced that

00:02:41.293 --> 00:02:43.763
the world's largest
indoor go-kart track

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:45.832
will open in New Jersey
later this year,

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:47.366
will include four passing lanes.

00:02:47.366 --> 00:02:48.635
But since it's in Jersey,

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:50.302
there will always be
a kid in the left lane

00:02:50.302 --> 00:02:51.804
going 15 miles per hour.

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:55.074
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:57.543
We have one writer
who lives in Secaucus.

00:02:57.543 --> 00:03:00.547
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.547 --> 00:03:04.217
We're gonna do what we always
do -- take his word for it.

00:03:04.217 --> 00:03:06.619
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:08.988
And finally, rapper Snoop Dogg
announced yesterday

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:10.823
he will release
a cannabis-infused

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:13.326
onion ring snack
called Snazzle Os.

00:03:13.326 --> 00:03:16.328
So, if you like marijuana
and you like onion rings,

00:03:16.328 --> 00:03:17.830
you don't say.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.865
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.865 --> 00:03:21.901
And that was the monologue,
everybody!

